[重构思路] 恢复把当前请求纳入统计的语义：tryCompressChat 增加可选 request 参数，统计时临时拼接但不写入历史。代码示例：
```ts
async tryCompressChat(prompt_id: string, force = false, request?: PartListUnion) {
  const history = this.getChat().getHistory(true);
  const forCounting = request ? [...history, createUserContent(request)] : history;
  const { totalTokens } = await this.getContentGeneratorOrFail().countTokens({ model, contents: forCounting });
}
```

