[重构思路] 要么沿用不改动 chat 历史的纯生成方式，要么把「先改后恢复」包进 try/catch 统一回滚。代码示例：
```ts
const originalHistory = this.getChat().getHistory(true);
try {
  this.getChat().setHistory(historyToCompress);
  const { text: summary } = await this.getChat().sendMessage({...}, prompt_id);
  ...
} catch (e) {
  this.getChat().setHistory(originalHistory);
  this.hasFailedCompressionAttempt = !force;
  return { originalTokenCount, newTokenCount: originalTokenCount, compressionStatus: CompressionStatus.COMPRESSION_FAILED_TOKEN_COUNT_ERROR };
}
```

[重构思路] 要么沿用不修改 chat 历史的生成方式（直接用 ContentGenerator/SendMessage 的纯请求能力生成摘要），要么把所有「先改后恢复」的操作放进 try/finally/catch 中统一回滚。代码示例：
```ts
const originalHistory = this.getChat().getHistory(true);
try {
  this.getChat().setHistory(historyToCompress);
  const { text: summary } = await this.getChat().sendMessage({...}, prompt_id);
  ...
} catch (e) {
  this.getChat().setHistory(originalHistory);
  this.hasFailedCompressionAttempt = !force;
  return { originalTokenCount, newTokenCount: originalTokenCount, compressionStatus: CompressionStatus.COMPRESSION_FAILED_TOKEN_COUNT_ERROR };
}
```

[重构思路] 先按 dir 分流：只对 left/right/up/down/home/end 计算布局，wordLeft/wordRight 直接返回；并保留 never 断言。代码示例：
```ts
if (dir === 'wordLeft') { ...; return ...; }
if (dir === 'wordRight') { ...; return ...; }
default: { const exhaustiveCheck: never = dir; return state; }
```

