[重构思路] 拆分「重排」与「光标映射」：布局按 [lines, viewportWidth] 记忆化，光标用 logicalToVisualMap 做 O(段数) 换算；并恢复宽度/码点缓存。代码示例：
```ts
const layout = useMemo(() => calculateLayout(lines, viewportWidth), [lines, viewportWidth]);
const visualCursor = useMemo(() => calculateVisualCursorFromLayout(layout, [cursorRow, cursorCol]), [layout, cursorRow, cursorCol]);
```

[重构思路] 把「重排」与「光标映射」拆开：布局仍按 [lines, viewportWidth] 记忆化，光标位置用布局中的 logicalToVisualMap 做 O(段数) 轻量换算；并恢复宽度/码点缓存或至少在 chunk 级别测量宽度。代码示例：
```ts
const layout = useMemo(() => calculateLayout(lines, viewportWidth), [lines, viewportWidth]);
const visualCursor = useMemo(() => calculateVisualCursorFromLayout(layout, [cursorRow, cursorCol]), [layout, cursorRow, cursorCol]);
```

